egin="01:04.190" end="01:07.070"><span begin="01:04.190" end="01:04.970">It's </span><span begin="01:04.970" end="01:05.930">my </span><span begin="01:05.930" end="01:07.070">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.120" end="01:18.230"><span begin="01:14.120" end="01:14.420">This </span><span begin="01:14.420" end="01:14.600">is </span><span begin="01:14.600" end="01:15.020">for </span><span begin="01:15.020" end="01:15.080">the </span><span begin="01:15.080" end="01:15.710">ones </span><span begin="01:15.710" end="01:15.800">who </span><span begin="01:15.800" end="01:16.340">stood </span><span begin="01:16.340" end="01:16.850">their </span><span begin="01:16.850" end="01:18.230">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.800" end="01:27.140"><span begin="01:21.800" end="01:21.980">For </span><span begin="01:21.980" end="01:22.670">Tommy </span><span begin="01:22.670" end="01:22.790">and </span><span begin="01:22.790" end="01:23.810">Gina </span><span begin="01:23.810" end="01:24.020">who </span><span begin="01:24.020" end="01:24.530">never </span><span begin="01:24.530" end="01:25.070">backed </span><span begin="01:25.070" end="01:27.140">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.750" end="01:33.710"><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:30.620">Tomorrow's </span><span begin="01:30.620" end="01:31.100">getting </span><span begin="01:31.100" end="01:31.550">harder </span><span begin="01:31.550" end="01:32.030">make </span><span begin="01:32.030" end="01:32.390">no </span><span begin="01:32.390" end="01:33.710">mistake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.770" end="01:35.510"><span begin="01:33.770" end="01:34.340">Luck </span><span begin="01:34.340" end="01:34.640">ain't </span><span begin="01:34.640" end="01:35.060">even </span><span begin="01:35.060" end="01:35.510">lucky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.510" end="01:38.690"><span begin="01:35.510" end="01:35.930">Got </span><span begin="01:35.930" end="01:35.990">to </span><span begin="01:35.